"OLAYLAR_ARKEOLOJI_D2_CIN_DOGU_ASYA:-0769-01-01:0":{"b": ["Beginning of the Eastern Zhou (King Ping's move east): Eastern Zhou: Ping Wang moves to Luoyi (traditional 770)", "c76a2a5b"], "d": ["With the collapse of the Western Zhou and King Ping's move to Luoyi (Wangcheng), the Eastern Zhou / Spring and Autumn period traditionally begins.", "7132f147"]},
