"OLAYLAR_ARKEOLOJI_D2_CIN_DOGU_ASYA:-13749-01-01:0":{"b": ["Beginning of the Jomon: Sosoki (Incipient) period: Sosoki (Jomon incipient phase) begins", "a893e4a1"], "d": ["The incipient phase of the Jomon culture (Japanese archipelago): pottery, temporarily sedentary hunting and gathering. The beginning is placed ~15,500 years ago with the first protruding-line (Ryusenmon) vessels.", "d2298f8f"]},
