"OLAYLAR_ARKEOLOJI_D3_ANADOLU_EGE:-1199-01-01:0":{"b": ["Evacuation of Hattusa — reading note on the 3rd wave: Hattusa is abandoned; the Hittite Empire collapses (about 1200)", "bdfe8ed5"], "d": ["The central administration evacuated Hattusa, and the city was burned only AFTERWARDS; drought (1198-1196±3) may have been part of the conditions of the collapse, but there is NO proven causality.", "6d29b755"]},
