"OLAYLAR_ARKEOLOJI_D3_ANADOLU_EGE:-1649-01-01:0":{"b": ["Hittite Old Kingdom — reign of Hattusili I (Labarna): the period of Hattusili I (hMC traditional value)", "17b63f56"], "d": ["The traditional reign of Hattusili I is c. 1650-1620 in the hMC; the beginning is found by counting back two 25-year generations from the Babylon 1595 datum of Mursili. The Hittite kingdom unified Central Anatolia at the end of the Middle Bronze Age.", "8b5469d2"]},
