"OLAYLAR_ARKEOLOJI_D3_ANADOLU_EGE:-9149-01-01:0":{"b": ["Klimonas and Shillourokambos (Cyprus, Early Aceramic Neolithic): the first sedentary villages on Cyprus (Klimonas)", "7f9f9d76"], "d": ["The villagers established at Klimonas lived 11,100-10,600 years ago (highest probability 10.8-10.6 cal kyBP). Shillourokambos Early A 10.4-10.0, Early B-C 10.0-9.6, Middle A ~9.5 cal kyBP (caption of Fig. 3, comparison).", "c01f6b39"]},
